# Vendored third-party sources (`cargo vendor`) must be stored byte-for-byte: cargo
# records each file's checksum in `.cargo-checksum.json`, so any line-ending rewrite
# (the repo-wide `* text=auto eol=lf`) would break the checksum and fail the build on
# checkout — notably on the Windows hive. Keep these verbatim and out of diffs/stats.
vendor/** -text -diff linguist-vendored linguist-generated
